// hr_c13: Hive City remaster, the cocktail bar balcony (camera c13), lower city level.
// No ReflectScale anywhere (the owner: floors were too reflective; the perforated floor kept at a low smoothness).
// smoothness scales the _gloss map (R smoothness, G metalness); "default" is the concrete-sound entry of materials.def.
